<title>UK: Salomon sets warrants on Swiss financial basket.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on Swiss financial basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers International, London said it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on a Swiss financial basket.</p>
<p>The basket consists of 4.4205 shares of Credit Suisse, 1.6084 shares of Zurich Insurance, 0.7761 shares of Winterthur Insurance and 0.5344 shares of Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p>One basket is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2670 CHF		  PREMIUM	8.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.40 CHF		  GEARING	11.12 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 26.FEB.97-07.AUG.98   PAYDATE	24.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2670 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
